        {
          "id": "67b74e69-b11f-484c-a35c-551308c5ba60",
          "name": "Upsert an Account",
          "request": {
            "name": "Upsert an Account",
            "description": {
              "content": "Creates a new account or updates an existing one. `domain` is required and is used as the primary identifier for matching.\n\n**Duplicate resolution** — the request is matched against existing accounts in the org by exact match on `domain`. If a match is found, that account is updated in place with the provided fields and returned; otherwise a new account is created (a company record for the domain must exist in our data sources).\n\n**Enrichment** — on creation, Monaco synchronously enriches the account with company firmographic data (industry, employee count, funding, etc.). This can make create requests take several seconds to complete; clients should use generous timeouts (10s+) and avoid issuing creates on hot paths.\n\nAny `tags` list provided is **appended** to the existing tags on the account.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "accounts",
                ""
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
